.TH kannadi-to-nudi 1  "to-nudi 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
kannadi\-to\-nudi \- Convert Unicode Kannada documents to Nudi glyph codes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkannadi to\-nudi\fR [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-\-font\fR] [\fB\-\-legacy\-font\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> <\fIINPUTS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert Unicode Kannada documents to Nudi glyph codes
.PP
Writes TXT, HTML and DOCX files. Text files are written in Windows\-1252. A PDF cannot be written back, so each PDF counts as an error.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Folder to write the converted files and reports to
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Exit with status 1 if any file has unknown glyphs, malformed syllables or unencodable characters; likely typos do not count
.TP
\fB\-\-font\fR \fI<NAME>\fR [default: Nudi 01 e]
Font to set converted text in, in HTML and DOCX files
.TP
\fB\-\-legacy\-font\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Treat this font as a legacy font too, so text already set in it is left as it is. Repeat for more fonts
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUTS\fR>
Files and folders to convert. Folders are searched for .txt, .htm, .html, .docx and .pdf files
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  kannadi to\-nudi letter.txt \-\-out for\-printing/ \-\-strict
  kannadi to\-nudi site/ \-\-font "Nudi 05 e" \-\-out nudi\-site/

Exit status:
  0  Success. Reports may still list problems and likely typos.
  1  \-\-strict was given and a file has a problem.
  2  Bad arguments, or a file that could not be read, converted or written.
     2 wins over 1 when both apply.
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.1
